 "insight": [
  "Exports to EU27 countries accounted for 83.1% of total exports in 2025.",
  "This share increased by 2.7% from 80.9% in 2005.",
  "Exports to non-EU27 countries decreased by 11.5% from 19.1% in 2005 to 16.9% in 2025, with a peak of 26.9% in 2011.",
  "The data show a clear shift towards EU27 countries as the main export partners over the period.",
  "Values are given in current euros and are not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
 ],
